AIRPCMND INITSPED 220.0m/s
AIRPCMND CTLTHROT 0.8
AIRPCMND CTLLDGEA FALSE
AIRPCMND INITFUEL 4%
AIRPCMND UNLOADWP
AIRPCMND LOADWEPN FLARE 80
INTENTIO
MINIALTI 50
DOGFIGHT G7.00 B15.00
ENDINTEN

AIRPLANE "MIG-29(RED/MULTIROLE)" FALSE
IDENTIFY 3
AIRPCMND POSITION -10500.0m 500.0m 9000.0m
